1
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,760
The defendant, Shen Shuyue,

2
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,880
has violated Article 232 of the Criminal
Law of the People's Republic of China,

3
00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,560
constituting the crime

4
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,340
of intentional homicide,

5
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,800
Article 234, Paragraph 2,

6
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,400
constituting the crime
of intentional injury,

7
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,680
and Article 260,

8
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,440
Paragraph 2,

9
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,300
constituting the crime of abuse.

10
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:29,960
She has shown extreme subjective malice,

11
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,240
employed cruel criminal methods,

12
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:32,840
and caused immense harm to society.

13
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:35,080
In accordance with Article 69, Paragraph 1
of the Criminal Law of the People's Republic of China,

14
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,760
it is recommended that
the defendant, Shen Shuyue,

15
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,880
be sentenced to life imprisonment

16
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:43,480
and deprived of political rights for life.

17
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:45,640
The other defendant
in this case, Luan Keguang,

18
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,880
as the father of the victim,
Luan Pingping,

19
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:50,160
not only failed to fulfill
his guardianship duties

20
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:53,320
but also formed a joint
criminal intent with Shen Shuyue.

21
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:55,320
The two conspired
to purchase methyltestosterone

22
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,160
and force-fed it to Luan Pingping

23
00:00:57,160 --> 00:00:58,480
to control her height

24
00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:00,000
for child modeling.

25
00:01:00,480 --> 00:01:02,440
On September 23, 2023,

26
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:03,520
the night of the incident,

27
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,280
after receiving

28
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:06,960
the video of forced feeding
sent by Shen Shuyue,

29
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:09,680
Luan Keguang failed to take
any measures to dissuade,

30
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:11,320
report to the police, or rescue,

31
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:12,920
allowing the death to occur.

32
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,160
I just didn't have time to stop it.

33
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,090
I didn't mean to.

34
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:17,600
Defendant Luan Keguang,

35
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:18,440
keep quiet.

36
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:22,120
The behavior of the defendant,

37
00:01:22,120 --> 00:01:25,160
Luan Keguang, has violated
Article 232 of the Criminal Law

38
00:01:25,160 --> 00:01:26,960
of the People's Republic of China,

39
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:28,640
constituting the crime
of intentional homicide.

40
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:31,080
In violation of Paragraph 2,

41
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:33,640
Article 234 of the Criminal Law of
the People's Republic of China,

42
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,280
constituting the crime of
intentional injury.

43
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:37,600
In violation of Paragraph 2,

44
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,560
Article 260 of the Criminal Law of
the People's Republic of China,

45
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,800
constituting the crime of abuse.

46
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:43,160
Pursuant to Paragraph 1,

47
00:01:43,160 --> 00:01:45,520
Article 69 of the Criminal Law of
the People's Republic of China,

48
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,280
we recommend sentencing the defendant,
Luan Keguang,

49
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,200
to 17 years in prison

50
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:52,600
and depriving him of political rights
for five years.

51
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,480
Hello,

52
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,440
fans of

53
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:10,120
Financial Express.

54
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:10,520
Today,

55
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:12,640
we have invited the famous economist

56
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:14,640
and Chairwoman of Yuanhe Investment,

57
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:15,680
Ms. Cui Xiangqin.

58
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:18,340
First, let's have Ms. Cui
say hello to everyone.

59
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,680
Hello, everyone.

60
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:21,160
I'm your economic advisor,

61
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:21,960
Cui Xiangqin.

62
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,920
Welcome, Ms. Cui.

63
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:27,280
Ms. Cui has a unique vision
in the field of investment.

64
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,960
I remember you once said

65
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:32,160
that the most important thing
in investment is to have a keen eye.

66
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:33,720
So, how does your keen eye

67
00:02:33,720 --> 00:02:35,850
view the current economic situation?

68
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,560
I've always believed

69
00:02:38,600 --> 00:02:40,730
that choice is as important as effort.

70
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,440
Because choice...

71
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:47,360
Ms. Cui,

72
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:49,400
Hurry!

73
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,170
Are you okay?

74
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,280
Turn off the livestream!

75
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:52,680
Hurry!

76
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:57,040
What did you put in my water?

77
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,120
Why are you trying to hurt me?

78
00:03:35,079 --> 00:03:36,480
That's just how Chang is.

79
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:40,040
He never mentions his own suffering

80
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:42,520
and always thinks of others.

81
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,650
He even lost his life in the mountains.

82
00:03:49,840 --> 00:03:51,240
I want you to see someone.

83
00:04:01,480 --> 00:04:02,480
Prosecutor Qiao,

84
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,400
you're looking for me?

85
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:03,880
Take a look at

86
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,480
this lady.

87
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:08,640
Hello.

88
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:11,440
You're Uncle Chang's wife.

89
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,080
I've seen you before.

90
00:04:14,960 --> 00:04:15,440
Ma'am,

91
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:17,500
I'm Zhang Ping.

92
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,200
You even

93
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,000
sewed cotton pants for me back then.

94
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,200
There were two little bear patches
on the knees.

95
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:22,880
You're

96
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:26,810
the skinny kid
who followed Senhai back then?

97
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:27,480
That's me.

98
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,560
Ma'am,

99
00:04:30,840 --> 00:04:32,300
when I was a kid, my parents

100
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,420
used to beat me.

101
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,900
They even broke my arm.

102
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,680
It was Uncle Chang who saved me.

103
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,760
He even paid for my schooling
out of his own pocket.

104
00:04:38,760 --> 00:04:39,420
Uncle Chang

105
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,320
was a hero.

106
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,930
I haven't forgotten him

107
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,010
all these years.

108
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,330
I'm a traffic cop

109
00:04:45,560 --> 00:04:46,320
now, too.

110
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,930
Protecting others,

111
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,220
just like Uncle Chang did.

112
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:51,680
That's great.

113
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:53,520
Alright,

114
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:54,580
that's all for now.

115
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,200
Actually, this kid was there too

116
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:01,280
on the day
of Lao Chang's memorial service.

117
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,800
You were too heartbroken then

118
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,460
and didn't want to see anyone.

119
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:05,760
After that,

120
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,160
he didn't dare to see you.

121
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:08,770
But all these years,

122
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,930
he has never forgotten what happened.

123
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:13,240
Those green dates you receive every year,

124
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,040
he picked them

125
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:14,920
himself and

126
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:15,850
sent them to you.

127
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:18,480
Yes.

128
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:20,800
I know

129
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:23,680
Lao Chang's passing has always been

130
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:25,440
hard for you to get over.

131
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,120
I'm in no position to advise you,

132
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,680
nor do I know how.

133
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,520
But Kaixin came to see me.

134
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,240
She said

135
00:05:34,159 --> 00:05:35,760
she wants to be a prosecutor.

136
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,000
I see Lao Chang

137
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,840
in her.

138
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:40,850
The kid takes after him.

139
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:43,450
She has the makings of a great prosecutor.

140
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,200
Prosecutor Qiao,

141
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,520
I understand

142
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,280
what you mean.

143
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:54,960
Tell you what,

144
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:57,860
I'll have a good talk
with Kaixin when I get back.

145
00:06:07,960 --> 00:06:08,480
Mom,

146
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:09,240
I'm home.

147
00:06:09,920 --> 00:06:10,480
Kaixin.

148
00:06:10,480 --> 00:06:11,210
You're back.

149
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,160
That's great.

150
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,080
You made so much food.

151
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:14,520
Yeah.

152
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,050
How is it?

153
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:16,640
Come on.

154
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:17,810
Sit down.

155
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:20,520
Can the two of us finish all this?

156
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,560
I agree to let you be a prosecutor.

157
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:26,400
Mom, you agreed!

158
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:28,520
But

159
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,660
can we switch departments

160
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:33,000
and leave the criminal division?

161
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,930
Prosecutor Qiao

162
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:35,500
said some things to me,

163
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,159
and I took them to heart.

164
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,520
But I still

165
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,650
have some concerns.

166
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:42,640
So,

167
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:43,880
I hope you can

168
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:46,280
understand how I feel.

169
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:48,240
Let's meet halfway.

170
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:49,720
After dinner,

171
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,620
write a transfer application

172
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,960
and hand it to Prosecutor Qiao tomorrow.

173
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:54,690
Don't worry.

174
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,560
From now on,

175
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:58,210
I won't interfere with your work anymore.

176
00:06:58,680 --> 00:06:59,680
What do you think?

177
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,520
I'll write it tomorrow.

178
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:02,880
It's

179
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:04,090
already so late.

180
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,240
Write it today.

181
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,920
I've already found a template for you.

182
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,250
You just need to copy it.

183
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,580
Come on,

184
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:12,440
let's eat.

185
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:13,780
Write it after dinner.

186
00:07:16,640 --> 00:07:17,370
You're back.

187
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:25,560
Why are you going through my things?

188
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,290
Give it to me.

189
00:07:29,760 --> 00:07:31,090
Why are you taking this?

190
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,960
What do you mean I'm taking this?

191
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:33,720
This isn't mine.

192
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,760
It belongs to my colleague.

193
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,360
I'm just keeping it for them.

194
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:37,240
Mom,

195
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,920
how long are you going
to keep this from me?

196
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:43,250
Do you really think I don't know anything?

197
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,240
What are you talking about?

198
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,480
You're taking this medicine

199
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:48,720
because you have
the same illness as Grandma.

200
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:49,450
You live here

201
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,920
not because it's close to work,

202
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,800
but because you and Dad got divorced.

203
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,200
I know everything.

204
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:55,920
Listen to me...

205
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,720
And last time,

206
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,040
I already told you

207
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,600
that you can tell me anything.

208
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:01,520
Am I really that untrustworthy to you?

209
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,080
How could I not trust you?

210
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,160
I wanted to wait until after your
high school entrance exam to tell you.

211
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:07,720
I didn't want to distract you.

212
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:08,960
With such a big thing happening at home,

213
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,320
am I supposed to just ignore it

214
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:11,920
and bury myself in studying?

215
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,240
Mom was wrong.

216
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,620
I didn't consider your feelings.

217
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,080
I'm sorry.

218
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:25,680
My illness

219
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,380
is different from
your grandma's back then.

220
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,920
My current treatment is working very well.

221
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:32,159
The doctor also said that

222
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:34,020
after a period of consolidation,

223
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,289
I can fully recover.

224
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,679
So please don't worry too much, okay?

225
00:08:37,679 --> 00:08:39,880
Your dad and I didn't separate
because I got sick,

226
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,320
but because we really aren't suitable
for each other,

227
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:42,780
so we decided to part ways.

228
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,760
When you grow up,

229
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:45,160
you'll naturally understand.

230
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:45,840
We will

231
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:48,120
get along in a different way.

232
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:50,420
But he will always be your dad.

233
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,480
And I will always be your mom.

234
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:53,810
That will never change.

235
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,280
Trust us, okay?

236
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,280
I trust you.

237
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:11,900
The case from two weeks ago
was sent over so quickly.

238
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:13,680
Prosecutor Qiao,

239
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:14,700
Have a seat.

240
00:09:14,760 --> 00:09:15,560
Don't mind me.

241
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,970
Let's look at the case brief first.

242
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:21,560
The deceased, Cui Xiangqin,

243
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:23,600
publicly accused the company's
general manager, Cheng Jia,

244
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:25,080
of being her murderer.

245
00:09:26,160 --> 00:09:27,800
The incident happened
during a live stream.

246
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:29,880
Cui Xiangqin suddenly bled
from her nose and mouth

247
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:32,040
and died after emergency efforts
by the paramedics failed.

248
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:32,880
Cui Xiangqin

249
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:34,520
had rheumatic heart disease

250
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:36,600
and underwent artificial
valve replacement.

251
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,880
She needed to take warfarin regularly

252
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:39,240
every morning.

253
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:42,080
And the police detected aspirin in the cup

254
00:09:42,080 --> 00:09:44,000
she drank from that day.

255
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:45,720
At the same time,
the common components of both drugs

256
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,720
were detected in her stomach.

257
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:50,760
The cause of death
has also been confirmed.

258
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:53,360
Let's watch the video first.

259
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:58,080
The paper Cheng Jia threw away has been
confirmed to be her own document,

260
00:09:58,080 --> 00:09:59,940
and it has her fingerprints on it.

261
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,880
Moreover, the internal drug residue

262
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:04,040
is consistent with the aspirin
detected in the cup.

263
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:04,960
is consistent with the aspirin
detected in the cup.

264
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:06,620
But Cheng Jia denied wrapping

265
00:10:06,680 --> 00:10:08,140
and placing the medicine.

266
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:11,040
Then what is Cheng Jia's
motive for murder?

267
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,240
They reconciled

268
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,360
after their argument.

269
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,000
Besides,

270
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:16,480
they are partners
in the same company after all.

271
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,040
And good friends for many years.

272
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:20,040
This has been confirmed

273
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,320
by the company's employees.

274
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:24,520
The problem now is that Cheng Jia
refuses to plead guilty.

275
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,400
This case happened during a live broadcast

276
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:30,000
and has already attracted
widespread social attention.

277
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,640
The police are highly efficient.

278
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:32,960
We also need to improve our efficiency

279
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:35,490
and push the case forward
as soon as possible.

280
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:37,200
Chang Kaixin,

281
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:38,320
Come to my office.

282
00:10:42,920 --> 00:10:44,360
Your mom pushed you to submit

283
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:46,620
this transfer application, didn't she?

284
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:48,200
What happened?

285
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,240
Couldn't reason with her,

286
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,570
or just couldn't say no?

287
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,600
Prosecutor Qiao,

288
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,040
my mom...

289
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:54,960
she's just worried

290
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,040
it's dangerous for me to handle
criminal cases in the First Division.

291
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,400
She wants me to either transfer

292
00:10:58,400 --> 00:10:59,520
or resign.

293
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,560
I really had no choice,

294
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:02,920
so I submitted it.

295
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:04,600
But Prosecutor Qiao,

296
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,600
I really don't want
to leave the First Division.

297
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:08,280
I understand your frustration.

298
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:09,410
Because of your dad,

299
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,000
your mom

300
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,330
values safety above everything else now.

301
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:14,080
It's not that she doesn't understand you.

302
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,680
She just can't take the risk.

303
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:18,640
However,

304
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,200
I won't approve this transfer request.

305
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,160
Cui Xiangqin's case

306
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,220
involves a lot now,

307
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,600
making the prosecution very difficult.

308
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,460
Give it your all

309
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,360
and close this case for me first.

310
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,160
But what about my mom?

311
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,000
Explain clearly to your mom

312
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,440
the preventive measures
of working in our department.

313
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:38,480
Tell her about your recent growth

314
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,880
and what real skills you've learned.

315
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:42,440
Let me give you a suggestion.

316
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,960
Follow through with this case first.

317
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,760
Getting results

318
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:45,520
to talk to your mom

319
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:46,920
is better than anything.

320
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,960
Thank you, Prosecutor Qiao.

321
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,040
I will definitely work hard.

322
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:52,440
I won't let down the trust
you and the team have in me.

323
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,170
Back to work.

324
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,040
Okay.

325
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,760
Turn off the livestream, quick!

326
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:12,920
Cheng Jia's reaction...

327
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:25,400
Cui Xiangqin had a sudden emergency.

328
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:26,280
Secretary Cui Bingzhong's

329
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:28,640
first reaction was to check on her.

330
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:32,250
Cheng Jia obviously cared more
about the public impact.

331
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,560
Chang Kaixin,

332
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,160
pack up.

333
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,460
Come with me to the detention center.

334
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,240
What's wrong?

335
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,440
You seem distracted.

336
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:06,980
No, I'm not.

337
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:08,440
Don't play dumb.

338
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:11,040
You were distracted
during the meeting earlier,

339
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,040
and you still are.

340
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:16,200
Cui Xiangqin's secretary,
Cui Bingzhong, is here.

341
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:18,130
Come with me to the reception room.

342
00:13:18,560 --> 00:13:19,080
Coming.

343
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:20,080
Wait for me.

344
00:13:20,080 --> 00:13:21,410
We'll play games later.

345
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,080
Wei,

346
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,240
did you just call me?

347
00:13:27,240 --> 00:13:27,840
What's up?

348
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:32,440
I said I'm going to see Cheng Jia.

349
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:33,880
Oh.

350
00:13:36,320 --> 00:13:38,040
I really didn't kill anyone.

351
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:39,760
You have to believe me.

352
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:41,240
Please.

353
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,570
Look into it carefully.

354
00:13:42,600 --> 00:13:44,640
There must be some misunderstanding.

355
00:13:44,640 --> 00:13:45,360
There must be

356
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,080
a problem somewhere.

357
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:49,560
We are re-verifying the chain of evidence

358
00:13:49,560 --> 00:13:51,000
and won't miss any suspicious points.

359
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,480
You can rest assured about that.

360
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:53,840
Still the same question.

361
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:56,000
Tell us about your relationship
with Cui Xiangqin first.

362
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,880
We had a pretty good relationship.

363
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,480
I became the general manager

364
00:13:59,680 --> 00:14:01,320
all thanks to Director Cui's support.

365
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,520
She was my benefactor,

366
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:03,520
my patron.

367
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,840
Why would I have any reason to kill her?

368
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:07,170
You didn't go to college

369
00:14:07,440 --> 00:14:09,560
and have no background in finance.

370
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:11,680
Why do you think she supported you?

371
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:12,160
Maybe

372
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,770
because I work hard.

373
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,900
I'm not afraid to tell you.

374
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,460
I got to where I am today

375
00:14:19,520 --> 00:14:21,680
by fighting my way up.

376
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,080
Of course,

377
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,960
I couldn't have done it
without Director Cui's support.

378
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:28,280
I am deeply grateful to her in my heart.

379
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,600
But we have other evidence showing

380
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,320
that you've been arguing
quite frequently lately.

381
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,520
Can you explain that?

382
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:37,480
How should I know?

383
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,680
It was like she was
picking fights on purpose.

384
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:41,320
One day,

385
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:42,920
she suddenly said

386
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:45,440
she wanted to hire
some professional manager.

387
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:47,640
How soon can that project be finalized?

388
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:50,410
We need it for the meeting this afternoon.

389
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:53,920
Hurry up.

390
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,380
We need it this afternoon.

391
00:14:57,240 --> 00:14:58,280
Sorry, Chairman Cui.

392
00:14:58,280 --> 00:15:00,680
We just have too much
going on at the company.

393
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:02,480
What did you want to see me about?

394
00:15:03,800 --> 00:15:05,280
Our company has indeed

395
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:06,540
been very busy lately.

396
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,120
I asked you here today

397
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:09,380
to tell you something.

398
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,850
I've hired a professional manager

399
00:15:11,920 --> 00:15:13,520
to help share your workload.

400
00:15:17,880 --> 00:15:18,880
I've been working

401
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:20,920
with you for years.

402
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:23,280
You should know what I'm capable of.

403
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:26,000
What do you mean
by suddenly bringing someone else in?

404
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,060
Don't you trust me?

405
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,690
It's not that I don't trust you.

406
00:15:30,080 --> 00:15:32,080
I'm just worried you're working too hard.

407
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,080
So I found someone

408
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:35,080
to help relieve your stress.

409
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:37,170
This person is highly capable.

410
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,400
I believe

411
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,200
you two will get along very well.

412
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:41,320
Cui Xiangqin,

413
00:15:42,480 --> 00:15:43,400
this is a notification,

414
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:44,480
not a discussion.

415
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,040
What exactly do you mean by this?

416
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:48,320
Mr. Cheng,

417
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:49,400
let me explain.

418
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:50,800
Save your explanations.

419
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:52,520
I just want you to know

420
00:15:53,440 --> 00:15:54,770
that I built everything

421
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,290
in this company for you.

422
00:15:56,520 --> 00:15:57,320
Don't forget,

423
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:58,650
I have a share

424
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,040
in this too.

425
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:15,080
Cheng Jia,

426
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:18,400
I gave you everything you have now.

427
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:21,920
Every employee in the company
has contributed.

428
00:16:21,920 --> 00:16:23,440
But if I don't want to give it,

429
00:16:23,440 --> 00:16:25,000
I can take it back anytime.

430
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:29,240
You're in no position
to negotiate with me.

431
00:16:29,400 --> 00:16:30,400
Listen to me on this.

432
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,200
It's settled.

433
00:16:31,600 --> 00:16:32,400
Cui Xiangqin,

434
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:33,840
don't push your luck.

435
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:35,720
I'm telling you,

436
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:37,120
it's out of the question.

437
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:41,480
I was really mad at the time.

438
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:44,040
Tell me, is that any way to handle things?

439
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:45,520
Was that a proper discussion?

440
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,580
Wasn't she just trying to kick me out?

441
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,860
Did you two have any conflicts

442
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,600
before this happened?

443
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:53,600
No.

444
00:16:54,520 --> 00:16:56,360
We've always gotten along well.

445
00:16:56,920 --> 00:16:58,720
Cui Bingzhong's testimony stated that

446
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,800
you two had another conflict later.

447
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,320
And you said

448
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,280
you wanted to kill Cui Xiangqin.

449
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:05,319
Did you say that?

450
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,760
Cui Xiangqin is a real jerk.

451
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,920
I worked so hard with her for so long,

452
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,520
and this is how she treats me.

453
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,339
I'll kill her sooner or later.

454
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:16,720
I...

455
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:17,800
Yes,

456
00:17:18,599 --> 00:17:19,200
I admit it.

457
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,520
But I was just venting.

458
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,119
How could I actually do that?

459
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:26,319
Before Cui Xiangqin died, she identified

460
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:27,599
you as her killer.

461
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:29,200
What do you have to say about that?

462
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:31,060
That must be a misunderstanding.

463
00:17:31,120 --> 00:17:32,720
She must have misunderstood me

464
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,560
to identify me like that.

465
00:17:35,320 --> 00:17:37,920
Do you know Cui Xiangqin's
real cause of death?

466
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,000
I heard it was...

467
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:43,500
poisoning.

468
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,000
Cui Xiangqin has rheumatic heart disease.

469
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,720
She takes Warfarin at 9:30 a.m. every day.

470
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:52,720
Did you know that?

471
00:17:54,080 --> 00:17:54,410
I did.

472
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:55,600
Then did you know

473
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:57,520
taking Warfarin and Aspirin together

474
00:17:57,520 --> 00:17:59,080
causes severe internal bleeding,

475
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:01,480
especially for someone with her condition?

476
00:18:01,480 --> 00:18:02,320
I knew.

477
00:18:03,800 --> 00:18:05,730
It was just something I overheard.

478
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:08,760
So I looked it up on my phone.

479
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:13,000
You should investigate Cui Bingzhong.

480
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:14,540
He has a motive for murder.

481
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:16,840
Why do you say that?

482
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:18,480
He's Chairman Cui's secretary.

483
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,480
He's always taken care of
the Chairman's daily life.

484
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:23,160
He knows every detail
of Cui Xiangqin's life.

485
00:18:23,600 --> 00:18:24,280
Who else

486
00:18:24,640 --> 00:18:26,240
would have the chance to do it?

487
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:27,360
Cui Bingzhong must have done it.
